[{"title":"鄂忠武王出师疏帖赞","author":"岳珂","text":"于惟绍兴，扶危支倾。\n揠校涖戎，不识一丁。\n先王奋呼，起自诸生。\n经通谊明，笔妙墨精。\n翠微之诗，五岳之盟。\n祁阳整旅，东松纪行。\n迹遍九州，气凌三精。\n粤时出师，首兹抗旌。\n规模弗愆，忠愤莫撄。\n上心载嘉，奎章式形。\n谓朕何忧，惟尔责成。\n以百万师，观我甲兵。\n仅四十里，复我旧京。\n日却阳侯，星陨中营。\n苌血遂碧，狐史漫青。\n天不诱衷，曷其底宁。\n伤哉离骚，坐此修能，冰镂芷馨。\n惟帝鉴忠，惟人与诚。\n烈并褒鄂，志恢幽并。\n有奕龙迹，遹昭骏声。\n遗墨既刊，大猷是经。\n对于庙祧，岂惟云仍。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":27375,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"黄鲁直书简帖赞","author":"岳珂","text":"诗至江西，始别宗派。\n字岂无祖，人其有待。\n鹤瘠鸾铩，松寒石怪。\n彼有发僧，尚闻謦欬。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":27376,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"黄鲁直食面帖赞","author":"岳珂","text":"山谷书法，本于天才。\n变而成家，如万壑崖。\n骨瘦气清，霜寒籁哀。\n故其言曰，法安出哉。\n我师我心，奚彼之侪。\n今观此书，自叶而荄。\n敛其角圭，以复成才。\n规矩崛奇，关机阖开。\n故其跋曰，自本心来。\n谁其知言，嘻噫絜斋。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":27377,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"黄鲁直催绣词帖赞","author":"岳珂","text":"词以寓意，何适非理。\n游戏翰墨，亦或张弛。\n此篇所传，观蜡之比。\n乐而不淫，庶几在此。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":27378,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"曾文昭时寒帖赞","author":"岳珂","text":"祖孙百年，兄弟一世。\n归乎其全，抑有公议。\n遗墨散轶，得自名裔。\n人其监兹，岂必名位。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":27379,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"葛文康书简帖赞","author":"岳珂","text":"辞以情达，义以气激。\n以素心期，托名手笔。\n都曹之获，中寓其一。\n尚想风流，太平人物。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":27380,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"韩忠献北道京邑二帖赞","author":"岳珂","text":"扶桑擎日，厥干万尺，以为公笔。\n天寿平格，元圭昭锡，以为公墨。\n阴阳阖辟，鳌柱立极，见此伟特。\n太山绝壁，九河碣石，莫动笔力。\n有云五色，曾著瑞籍，多士辟易。\n繄天实启，岂以诩饰，如彼韦陟。\n公骑鹏翼，归侍帝侧，有是遗迹。\n荣光交射，星月珠璧，终古不忒。\n维珂之得，再拜叹息，坱圠孰测。\n几几赤舄，尚想公德，永镇下国。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":27381,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"潘子贱改月帖赞","author":"岳珂","text":"公立柱下，直声凛如。\n气则不馁，而况于书。\n待人以情，真意浃洽。\n于嗟前修，动则可法。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":27382,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"颜真卿朝回帖赞","author":"岳珂","text":"公之素守，日烈霜严。\n公之大节，斗揭岩瞻。\n笔势所存，心画可占。\n八法具体，匪柔匪铦。\n庶汇流形，如鶱如潜。\n坱圠是似，端倪孰觇。\n人以艺进，公以德兼。\n凛其高风，气压万签。\n公神在天，公书在奁。\n系赞以藏，震于壬憸。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":27383,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"薛黄门春聚帖赞","author":"岳珂","text":"九字在纸，落落晨星。\n此帖之传，犹及太平。\n意象轩昂，足称其名。\n作此赞焉，惟字之评。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":27384,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"徽宗皇帝诗联扇面御书赞","author":"岳珂","text":"四海如春，时维帝心。\n遇物而感，其传至今。\n宫扇之存，有此神翰。\n愿扬仁风，慰彼涂炭。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":27385,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"宁宗皇帝诗卷耳篇御书赞","author":"岳珂","text":"伟王人之典学，本天纵之多能。\n续六艺之绝业，环诸儒而讲明。\n璧跗蔚其流芳，琼字焕其腾英。\n居蠖濩而储精，炳龟龙而效灵。\n岁嘉定之辛巳，历九闰而时乘。\n旦孜孜而忘倦，志兢兢而靡矜。\n诗三百有五篇，沃帝心而日聆。\n俨露门之未竟，已云章之满籯。\n繄是诗之四章，首二南而仪刑。\n凡家齐而国治，本大学之为经。\n自求贤而审官，见济济之以宁。\n越染翰之虽同，兹注意之实形。\n昔德寿之在御，尝史汉之留情。\n传复古之奇迹，亦流辉于古荆。\n有词臣曰万里，亟再拜而震惊。\n谓缝掖之所难，而帝王之躬行。\n今宝章之诞贲，知祖武之克绳。\n殆家法之相似，联自检于宫庭。\n眇周行之下走，方虺隤而于征。\n竦昭回之景光，愧抱椠之馀生。\n览盈咫之昭华，想绎纯于九成。\n得猗那而藏焉，尚庙瑟之馀声。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":27386,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"向伯恭旁午帖赞","author":"岳珂","text":"涂水涟漪未改，芗林风月如新。\n一纸重观遗迹，百年无复斯人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":27387,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"米元章黄龙帖赞","author":"岳珂","text":"华胄遥遥楚国，宗风的的曹溪。\n唤起争名米老，奎光长照珍题。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":27388,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"张长史秋深帖赞","author":"岳珂","text":"炜五帖兮迨今，信第一兮秋深。\n彼伯高兮书淫，人争取兮千金。\n考步武兮可寻，付纤秾兮何心。\n媲关沈兮鸣琴，尚海岳兮知音。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":27389,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"陈参政简易帖赞","author":"岳珂","text":"眼底中兴日月，手中建笔虹霓。\n造化功成秋兔，先生原有新诗。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":27390,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"欧阳询阴符经帖赞","author":"岳珂","text":"内史书如率令，善奴秀比官奴。\n千古会稽楷则，于今重见阴符。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":27391,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"得陈元履家书六言四首 其四","author":"岳珂","text":"窥户几回鹊喜，绕阶一夜蛩吟。\n痛饮政须似旧，安居且愿如今。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":27392,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"得陈元履家书六言四首 其三","author":"岳珂","text":"安问经时落落，边声镇日摇摇。\n寄贺塞翁马失，决疑天老龟焦。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":27393,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"得陈元履家书六言四首 其二","author":"岳珂","text":"老病两无世用，谋谟百不如人。\n喜见东床论事，谁言下榻生尘。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":27394,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"得陈元履家书六言四首 其一","author":"岳珂","text":"病骨经秋易怯，人情比日多疏。\n惊起打门军将，传来置驿家书。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":27395,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"塔灯六言四绝 其三","author":"岳珂","text":"中天半倚寥泬，大帝高居郁萧。\n已讶流铃掷火，还疑绛节来朝。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":27396,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"塔灯六言四绝 其二","author":"岳珂","text":"七层灵燄自照，万里劫风不吹。\n烽信断无泽国，神光恰似天池。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":27397,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"塔灯六言四绝 其四","author":"岳珂","text":"碧落星移象纬，红光影射鲛宫。\n甲煎千门初启，明珠九曲先通。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":27398,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"塔灯六言四绝 其一","author":"岳珂","text":"金轮示现清夜，火树高腾碧虚。\n说法未回坡应，册勋先到钟鱼。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":27399,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"木兰花慢","author":"岳珂","text":"试晨妆淡伫，正疏雨、过含章。\n早巧额回春，岭云护雪，十里清香。\n何人剪冰缀玉，仗化工、施巧付东皇。\n瘦尽绮窗寒魄，凄凉画角斜阳。\n孤山西畔水云乡。\n篱落亚疏篁。\n问多少幽姿，半归图画，半入诗囊。\n如今梦回帝国，尚迟迟、依约带湖光。\n多谢胆瓶重见，不堪三弄横羌。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":27400,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"生查子","author":"岳珂","text":"芙蓉清夜游，杨柳黄昏约。\n小院碧苔深，润透双鸳薄。\n暖玉惯春娇，簌簌花钿落。\n缺月故窥人，影转阑干角。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":27401,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"祝英台近 其一 登多景楼","author":"岳珂","text":"瓮城高，盘径近。\n十里笋舆稳。\n欲驾还休，风雨苦无准。\n古来多少英雄，平沙遗恨。\n又总被、长江流尽。\n倩谁问。\n因甚衣带中分，吾家自畦畛。\n落日潮头，慢写属镂愤。\n断肠烟树扬州，兴亡休论。\n正愁尽、河山双鬓。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":27402,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"祝英台近 其二 北固亭","author":"岳珂","text":"澹烟横，层雾敛。\n胜概分雄占。\n月下鸣榔，风急怒涛飐。\n关河无限清愁，不堪临鉴。\n正霜鬓、秋风尘染。\n漫登览。\n极目万里沙场，事业频看剑。\n古往今来，南北限天堑。\n倚楼谁弄新声，重城正掩。\n历历数、西州更点。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":27403,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"满江红","author":"岳珂","text":"小院深深，悄镇日、阴晴无据。\n春未足，闺愁难寄，琴心谁与？\n曲径穿花寻蛱蝶，虚阑傍日教鹦鹉。\n笑十三杨柳女儿腰，东风舞。\n云外月，风前絮。\n情与情，长如许。\n想绮窗今夜，为谁凝伫？\n洛浦梦回留佩客，秦楼声断吹箫侣。\n正黄昏时候杏花寒，廉纤雨。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":27404,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"酹江月/念奴娇","author":"岳珂","text":"天然灵种，遍尘寰、不许一枝分植。\n瀛海沈沈群玉宴，迥出八仙标格。\n珠幄留云，翠绡笼雪，浅露宫黄额。\n无双亭下，未容凡卉连璧。\n犹是射虎归来，朱阑独倚，曾作东风客。\n素态自羞时态改，何必铅华倾国。\n舞影鸾孤，绕心蝶倦，占断春消息。\n月明十里，坐中还记曾识。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":27405,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"醉落魄/一斛珠","author":"岳珂","text":"铜彝绣箔。\n风流不到临春阁。\n婆娑清影来岩壑。\n梅魄兰魂，香染九秋萼。\n蕊仙拥下青瑶幕。\n粟肌透入黄金约。\n有人奚酉逢鱼摸。\n欲插还羞，重把鬓云掠。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":27406,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其三","author":"岳珂","text":"尚有奏篇烦狗盗，肯辞驰传为駹臣。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":27407,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其一","author":"岳珂","text":"动指不须占染鼎，去毛切莫拗蒸壶。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":27408,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其二","author":"岳珂","text":"片云出岫犹知倦，流水吟湘肯伴牢。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":27409,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"病虎行","author":"岳珂","text":"长风吹谷白日暗，旷野人稀云黯澹。\n狐狸啸舞豺狼嘷，病虎妥尾行蓬蒿。\n天寒泉冻山骨高，皮枯髀痒霜爪搔。\n纷纷晴雪爮落毛，垂头帖耳身腥臊。\n群鸦槎牙噪古木，燐火半青新鬼哭。\n走麇过前不能逐，目视眈眈蹲朴?。\n毛风血雨天地肃，何日跳踉看食肉。\n天生万物有盛时，当年一啸天助威。\n坐看云起行引儿，当涂宁复论老罴。\n一朝老去守岩窦，落叶满山冰雪后。\n壮心空在筋力疲，寂寞长饥眠白昼。\n古来豪杰多沈沦，不用为鼠皆若人。\n范雎折胁西入秦，内史长叹田甲嗔。\n可怜百兽为披靡，转顾不如圈中豕。\n男儿奋跲亦渠似，肯复虚为倚崖死。\n君不见南山白额曾报恩，墙头金枕投何人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":27410,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"过灵山述怀","author":"岳霖","text":"折腰为米本忧贫，流落天南瘴海滨。\n千里云山空别恨，十年萍梗可伤神。\n拊膺但觉丹心壮，览镜那堪白发新。\n归去恩深知感激，只惭无德愧斯民。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":27411,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"游越山","author":"幸元龙","text":"上得越山半，方壶紫翠环。\n山幽春溜响，花落午阴闲。\n梵刹依松外，仙家在竹间。\n小窗借高枕，风定鸟绵蛮。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":27412,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"赠养素先生","author":"庞昌","text":"圣泽浓云隐逸身，道装宜用葛为巾。\n祝融峰下醉明月，绿水源头钓紫鳞。\n曾见海桃三结子，不知仙豆几回春。\n他年我若功成去，愿作云桥跪履人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":27413,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"致爽轩","author":"庞淞","text":"平生珍货不肯市，岁岁梅花伴幽独。\n买邻不用一钱费，风月逢原俱取足。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":27414,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句","author":"庞清孙","text":"当时若为苍生出，安得云溪不朽名。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":27415,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"无题二首 其二","author":"庞谦孺","text":"可惜花无主，分明枉过春。\n谁怜桃李艳，却属路行人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":27416,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"无题二首 其一","author":"庞谦孺","text":"春风桃李容，能得几时好。\n谁怜涧底花，自对春风老。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":27417,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"使虏过汴京作","author":"庞谦孺","text":"苍龙观阙东风外，黄道星辰北斗边。\n月照九衢平似水，胡儿吹笛内门前。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":27418,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"绝句","author":"庞谦孺","text":"小雨收溪北，微云没舍西。\n地暄鹦鹉斗，日暖鹧鸪啼。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":27419,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"绝句三首 其三","author":"庞谦孺","text":"大别寺前春草深，凤栖山下汉江清。\n空村野陇谁为主，赖有流移旅客耕。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":27420,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"绝句三首 其二","author":"庞谦孺","text":"汉口风光恼杀人，绿杨无数绕江津。\n草堂日日来新燕，钓艇时时得锦鳞。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":27421,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"绝句三首 其一","author":"庞谦孺","text":"楚天落日暮云浮，痛饮狂歌不觉愁。\n醉眼山光似乡曲，怎知身在汉江头。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":27422,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"闻虏人败于柘皋作口号十首 其十","author":"庞谦孺","text":"今年太岁火逢辛，火德炎炎照紫宸。\n眼看点虏遭天破，未必朝廷用一人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":27423,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"闻虏人败于柘皋作口号十首 其九","author":"庞谦孺","text":"一自官军报捷频，番人无数愿归明。\n渠魁未必能方略，所恃多多以力争。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":27424,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"闻虏人败于柘皋作口号十首 其八","author":"庞谦孺","text":"战伐无多生女真，人传强半是签军。\n可怜尽死天兵手，但恐官家不得闻。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":27425,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"闻虏人败于柘皋作口号十首 其七","author":"庞谦孺","text":"闻道诸军遣背嵬，柘皋合战打头回。\n不烦宣抚亲提剑，铁塔前锋一布摧。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":27426,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"闻虏人败于柘皋作口号十首 其六","author":"庞谦孺","text":"京口人来说禁江，似闻胡骑再跳梁。\n夜来急递传新报，见说官军战顺昌。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":27427,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"闻虏人败于柘皋作口号十首 其五","author":"庞谦孺","text":"胡马纵横压上流，朝廷岁岁讲防秋。\n相公必欲安淮甸，早发官兵据寿州。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":27428,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"闻虏人败于柘皋作口号十首 其四","author":"庞谦孺","text":"黏罕中间陷两京，当时兀朮尚无名。\n如今索斗无时了，不使山川见太平。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":27429,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"闻虏人败于柘皋作口号十首 其三","author":"庞谦孺","text":"文武宣和盛两班，当时都道取燕山。\n三京随手残烧尽，今日谁迎二圣还。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":27430,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"闻虏人败于柘皋作口号十首 其二","author":"庞谦孺","text":"铁鹞乘时转海津，兜牟闪闪白如银。\n只今边郡羞投拜，淮北淮南正杀人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":27431,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"闻虏人败于柘皋作口号十首 其一","author":"庞谦孺","text":"正阳门下草还生，宫殿无人也自春。\n上皇昔日登临地，愁杀当时老大臣。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":27432,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"日暮","author":"庞谦孺","text":"水底晃微霞，孤村古路叉。\n稻檐排冻雀，牛背落昏鸦。\n行客犹贪路，归帆未到家。\n交游书札断，寂寞过天涯。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":27433,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"还至吴兴春事已过绿阴森然小圃可爱摘青梅尝煮酒一首","author":"庞谦孺","text":"为客清霜重，归来夏木苍。\n鸡鹅惊甚大，童稚觉微长。\n花絮今无迹，园林未肯荒。\n青梅应可摘，腊酒要开尝。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":27434,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"答何中丞伯寿","author":"庞谦孺","text":"三载皇舆驻武林，宫前新柳渐成阴。\n西湖风月愁难度，艮岳峰峦梦枉寻。\n老马惊思归汴路，寒江吼激破胡心。\n白蘋洲上怀乡久，夜夜啼鹃卧未深。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":27435,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"古诗 其二","author":"庞谦孺","text":"十旬五旬病，三日两日饿。\n闭门本求安，岁月不可过。\n秋成尚百日，急迫如星火。\n西风吹楸林，木叶朝来堕。\n夕阳下城头，蟋蟀鸣户左。\n褰裳临溪水，照影非昔我。\n悲歌动邻里，惨惨风满座。\n怀深声愈凄，辞绝意难和。\n人生一世间，太半逢坎坷。\n为乐须及时，倏忽伤老大。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":27436,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"古诗 其四","author":"庞谦孺","text":"初日照池底，游鱼戏涟漪。\n落日延西林，蜻蜓弄斜晖。\n忘情体自适，不但禽鸟微。\n以兹慰心胸，富贵如何违。\n舍策看清溪，步屧临荆扉。\n青天委长流，孤云无所依。\n居然忘物我，身世忽若遗。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":27437,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"古诗 其六","author":"庞谦孺","text":"送客出河门，返手闭篱关。\n归来悬午窗，坐看屋上山。\n众雏困未觉，捣药声已残。\n倦鸟止不飞，鸡犬亦在栏。\n高林静白日，时觉鸟声闲。\n寂寂穷巷中，翳翳桑柘间。\n不妨麻稻香，无时来鼻端。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":27438,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"古诗 其一","author":"庞谦孺","text":"处身乾坤中，适意乃其常。\n贫贱亦天然，尤怨徒自伤。\n平生赋命薄，守己岂不良。\n量分稍过差，神理翻百殃。\n苟无济世具，希进未免狂。\n鄙哉绵上人，远迹空潜藏。\n市朝车马喧，不碍松菊芳。\n何妨著衣冠，用舍姑逢场。\n傥无侥倖心，世亦不见戕。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":27439,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}}]